# GCP service account keys — never commit these (see .env.example's
# PROFESSORVGC_FIRESTORE_CREDENTIALS_PATH). Matches the common naming
# conventions the GCP Console downloads a key under, as a safety net in
# case one ever lands inside the repo despite being told to live outside it.
*service-account*.json
*-key.json
firestore-key*.json
